{"repositoryId":1148365504,"availability":"available","full":"muhittincamdali/SwiftUI-iOS26-Showcase","name":"SwiftUI-iOS26-Showcase","description":"Sixteen runnable SwiftUI demos of the APIs new in iOS 26 and macOS 26, from Liquid Glass to Foundation Models.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Swift","stars":22,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-02T22:04:45Z","updated":"2026-10-15T01:52:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://muhittincamdali.github.io/SwiftUI-iOS26-Showcase/","topics":["apple","demo","foundation-models","ios","ios26","liquid-glass","macos","showcase","swift","swift-package-manager","swiftui"],"demo":"https://muhittincamdali.github.io/SwiftUI-iOS26-Showcase/documentation/swiftuiios26showcase/buildingademobrowser","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T09:34:18.360Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T09:34:18.360Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T09:34:18.360Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T09:34:18.360Z","stars":22,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English · Türkçe · 简体中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Español · Deutsch · Français · Português (Brasil) · Русский","SwiftUI iOS 26 Showcase is a Swift package with sixteen small SwiftUI screens, each built around one group of APIs that are new in iOS 26 and macOS 26: Liquid Glass, the new bar and scroll modifiers, rich text editing, the native web view, 3D charts, SF Symbol draw effects, the @Animatable macro and the on-device Foundation Models framework. Every screen has controls to try the API's options and lists the SDK symbols it uses. It is for developers who want to see these APIs working before they use them: run the whole gallery, or drop a single screen into your own app."],"features":["16 demos in 6 categories: Liquid Glass, bars and navigation, scrolling and layout, text","and web, charts and symbols, and Apple Intelligence. 14 of them also run on macOS.","Searchable gallery: ShowcaseGallery lists the demos available on the curre